{{etymid|fi|icecream}}
From {{m|fi||Suomen Eskimo|Finnish Eskimo}}, a former ice cream maker that introduced the ice cream bar into the Finnish market. The ice cream was still sold as {{m|fi||Eskimo}} until the name was retired in 2020, although it still remains a trademark.

